- Step 5 MAV and coder use capture site `step5-review-fixes` but repair-loop site `step5-mav --checks-site step5-review-fixes`. Do not collapse that distinction; repeat the pair on every repair-loop re-entry per `checks-repair-loop.md` section 2.
